  "musicbrainz_annotation": "Trivia: Octavarium was the last album to be recorded in The Hit Factory (New York) before this famous recording studio - which has seen artists like John Lennon, Michael Jackson, Bruce Springsteen, Stevie Wonder, Madonna, U2, The Rolling Stones and many more - finally closed its doors.\r\n\r\nAlso: the album should have been called Octave first, but [http://musicbrainz.org/artist/9e57e406-4fb1-40d0-bcd2-2aa1d6390c1d.html|Spock's Beard] released their album [http://musicbrainz.org/album/36f6b246-fd03-4d91-b5ad-db4388c95c57.html|Octane] earlier in 2005.",
